Ini isinya, tinggal copy ke file `.gitignore` di root project kamu:

```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Database
data/leads.db
*.db
*.sqlite3

# Env / secrets
.env

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Pytest / coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
```